<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Delivery - Farm2Home</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"></head><body>
<nav><h2>🌾 Farm2Home</h2><ul><li><a href="/dashboard">Deliveries</a></li><li><a href="/logout">Logout</a></li></ul></nav>
<div class="container"><h1>Delivery Dashboard</h1><p>Welcome, <%= currentUser.name %>. Claim an order and deliver it to the customer.</p><div style="margin-top:25px"><% if(!orders.length){ %><div class="card"><p>No orders are currently waiting for delivery.</p></div><% } else { orders.forEach(o=>{ %><div class="order-card"><div class="topbar"><h3>Order #<%= o._id.toString().slice(-8) %></h3><span class="badge"><%= o.status %></span></div><p><strong>Customer:</strong> <%= o.customer ? o.customer.name : "Customer" %></p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <%= o.customer ? o.customer.phone : "" %></p><p><strong>Address:</strong> <%= o.deliveryAddress %></p><p><strong>Items:</strong> <%= o.items.map(i=>i.productName+" × "+i.quantity+" "+i.unit).join(", ") %></p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/orders/<%= o._id %>">View Order</a><% if(!o.deliveryPerson){ %><form action="/orders/<%= o._id %>/delivery" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="claim"><button>Claim Delivery</button></form><% } else if(o.deliveryPerson.toString()===currentUser.id){ %><form action="/orders/<%= o._id %>/delivery" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delivered"><button class="btn-orange">Mark Delivered</button></form><% } %></div></div><% })} %></div></div></body></html>